{
  "id": "unique-event-005",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#5 - Pighead\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,22,35]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "As you step into the farm, you are\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,35,70]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "surrounded by lean, evil looking\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,70,103]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "pigs and a farmer wearing the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,103,133]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "bloodied skin of a pig’s head as a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,133,168]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "grisly mask. The man is a giant and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,168,204]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "he is armed with a dirty pitchfork.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,204,240]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "He asks if you have brought food\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,240,273]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "for his pigs. You may sacrifice 3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,273,307]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Food points, or 1 dose of Bone\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,307,338]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "powder and avoid this encounter.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,338,371]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Otherwise, you must fight the man\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,371,405]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and his pigs.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,405,419]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Pighead, Level 5 slasher, 3 Life,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,419,453]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "damage 2.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,453,463]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6 Pigs, Level 3, 2 Life each,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,463,493]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "damage 1.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,493,503]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The pigs surround you. You may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,503,534]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "try to Escape only after you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,534,568]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "killed at least 3 pigs. If you slay\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,568,604]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Pighead and all the pigs, you may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,604,638]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "further investigate the farm by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,638,670]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "going to unique event #6.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,670,696]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Once you have killed Pighead,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,696,726]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "ignore this event if it happens\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,726,758]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "again.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,758,765]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you survive this encounter, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,765,800]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "may butcher each pig into d6 Food\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,800,834]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "points. All required ingredients\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,834,867]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and tools are easily found in the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,867,901]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-005:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "area.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,901,907]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    79
  ]
}
